fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:29:34.7240883Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:29:34.7241722Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:29:34.7242157Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:29:34.7242303Z If you would like to
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:29:34.7242609Z see the output, try like this:
